<div align="center"><h2>AGN Needs Your Help</h2></div>

<div class=default_9>

With the expansion of our network, we have grown to the point where we need YOUR help in providing the best information to the gaming community.  If you think you have what it takes, lend your support while earning great benefits at the same time.  We currently have multiple positions open on several sites:
<br><br>
<strong>SWGcenter.com</strong> - [<a href="#1">click here</a>]
<br>
<strong>LordsofEQ.com</strong> - [<a href="#2">click here</a>]
<br>
<strong>Brainburst.com</strong> - [<a href="#3">click here</a>]
<br><a name="1"></a>

<br><br>

<strong>SWGcenter.com</strong>
<br>
<strong><em><li>Premium Authors<br></em></strong>
SWG is looking for Premium Authors, who can earn a guaranteed rate of <strong>at least $30 per article</strong> for any published guides.  Are you the best of the best and what to prove it?  Here is your chance to show the SWG community what you know, and earn some pocket money at the same time.  Please see our <a href="http://www.swgcenter.com/PointSystem/Article.asp">Submission Guidelines</a> 
<br><br>

<strong><em><li>Bestiary Database Moderator (1 positions)<br></em></strong>
The Bestiary Moderator will be expected to moderate and update the mobs, trainers, etc, including reviewing other entries, adding new information, and keeping the database up to date.
<br><br>

<strong><em><li>Pet Database Moderator (1 positions)<br></em></strong>
The Pet Moderator will be expected to moderate and update the tamable babies in the bestiary and to help out with the beast information entry, including reviewing other entries, adding new information, and keeping the database up to date.

<br><br>

If you are interested in helping us be the best resource possible for the SWG community and receive a few great benefits in return, <a href="mailto:submit@swgcenter.com">send us an email</a>. Please include the following information: 
<br><br>

<li>Point System Username 
<li>Average amount of hours spent playing SWG weekly 
<li>Professions and levels of completion in those professions 
<li>Any other reasons or qualifications for wanting to be a contributor, and special qualifications for the position applying for.
<br><br>

In return you will get the following great benefits:
<br><br>

<li>Premium Membership for all of the AGN Premium sites during your tenure! 
<li>Moderator status for the section of the site that you are updating and recognition for that section of the site.
<li>The knowledge that you are helping to create the ultimate resource for the SWG community. 

<br><a name="2"></a>
<br>
<br>
<strong>LordsofEQ.com</strong>
<br>
<strong><em><li>Feature Article Authors<br></em></strong>
LoEQ is looking for Feature Authors for articles, comics, and player and game staff interviews.  Feature writers will be expected to write weekly, and to produce original content for the Lords of Everquest community.
<br><br>

<strong><em><li>News Reporter (1 position)<br></em></strong>
LoEQ's News Reporter will be responsible for scouring the internet for the latest news and issues relating to Lords of Everquest, Everquest and Everquest II, and RTS games.
<br><br>

<strong><em><li>Tip and Pic of the Day Coordinators (2 positions)<br></em></strong>
LoEQ's daily content coordinators will be expected to manage the daily function of their feature, including the images, captions, and editing for each feature.
<br><br>

<strong><em><li>Forum Moderators<br></em></strong>
LoEQ's Forum Moderators will be responsible for keeping our forums clean and suitable for the LoEQ community.
<br><br>

If you are interested in helping us be the best resource possible for the LoEQ community and receive a few great benefits in return, <a href="mailto:rmoore@ascensionweb.com">send us an email</a>. Please include the following information: 
<br><br>

<li>Past RTS experience
<li>Primary faction played
<li>Past writing or moderation experience, if any, including links
<li>Any other reasons or qualifications for wanting to be a contributor
<br><br>

In return you will get the following great benefits:
<br><br>

<li>Premium Membership for all of the AGN Premium sites during your tenure! 
<li>Forum title designating your position
<li>The knowledge that you are helping to create the ultimate resource for the LoEQ community. 
<br><a name="3"></a>
<br>
<br>

<strong>Brainburst.com</strong>
<br>

<strong><em><li>Magic the Gathering News Reporters (2 positions)<br></em></strong>
Our News Reporters will be responsible for scouring the internet for the latest news and issues relating to Magic the Gathering, news and issues, and Wizards of the Coast.
<br><br>

<strong><em><li>Deck Entrants and Moderators (2 positions)<br></em></strong>
Our Deck Database Moderators will be expected to moderate our decks database and submit links or lists of top 8 decklists.
<br><br>

If you are interested in helping us be the best resource possible for the Magic community and receive a few great benefits in return, <a href="mailto:submit@brainburst.com">send us an email</a>. Please include the following information: 
<br><br>

<li>Past moderation or contribution experience, if any
<li>Magic experience and hours spent playing weekly
<li>Daily availability
<br><br>

In return you will get the following great benefits:
<br><br>

<li>Premium Membership for all of the AGN Premium sites during your tenure! 
<li>Forum title designating your position
<li>The knowledge that you are helping to create the ultimate resource for the Magic community. 
<br><br>

<strong><em><li>Card of the Week Artist (1 position)<br></em></strong>
If selected, you will be expected to create the weekly Card of the Week for Brainburst.com fantasy card contest.
<br><br>

Please send us the following information:

<li>Name
<li>Photoshop or other image program experience
<li>Three sample Fantasy Card creations (the whole card, not just the art)
<br><br>

In return you will get the following great benefits:
<br><br>

<li>Premium Membership for all of the AGN Premium sites during your tenure! 
<li>Forum title designating you as the Brainburst CotW Editor
<li>The knowledge that you are helping to create the ultimate resource for the Magic community. 
<br><br>



</div>

